# voice-intake — environment template.
# Copy to voice-intake.env (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit the real file.

# --- Engine dir (the production intake loop, stays in place) ----------------
# Holds GOAL-PROMPT.md (canonical behavior spec), the .processed-memos.json SHA
# ledger, transcripts, and intake reports. Default is the production location.
OCEAN_VOICE_INTAKE_ENGINE_DIR="/Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/Voice Memos To Do"

# --- Linear GraphQL (teams SALE / OUT / CAMP / CONT / OCEAN) -----------------
# Personal API key, sent as the raw Authorization header. The engine's legacy
# token-file convention is documented in GOAL-PROMPT.md; prefer the env var.
LINEAR_API_KEY=

# --- GitHub ------------------------------------------------------------------
# No key here — `gh` uses its own authenticated login (gh auth status).

# --- Ocean daemon (the brain) ------------------------------------------------
# Where a driver POSTs /v1/prompt. Default matches the daemon's bind.
OCEAN_DAEMON_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4780
